{"id": "official:sentence:688c1fe7-b4f8-4b5a-b8bf-9bad6a614870", "text": "我想知道她去哪儿了。", "shortMeaning": "我想知道她去了哪里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0965a3b0-9b21-4cdd-8afd-6d0ad23dbae1", "text": "我想知道她发生什么事了。", "shortMeaning": "我想知道她出了什么事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
