{"id": "official:sentence:534bdee8-8b06-4d9b-ae6f-c8f717916541", "text": "我想要按摩。我需要放松。", "shortMeaning": "我想要按摩，需要放松。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1d5c195b-c0b6-4ed6-b0d0-5918b4a7bf79", "text": "我想要更详细的信息。", "shortMeaning": "我要更详细的信息。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:94a8d61a-6ad5-4c2c-b3ee-6d5178b4d62c", "text": "我想要有我自己的房间。", "shortMeaning": "我想要有自己的房间。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:567b5d70-29f2-4984-9066-cbfe3899c30a", "text": "我想要本书。书店在什么地方？", "shortMeaning": "我想要本书，书店在哪儿？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a1c2bf05-4d26-4fa6-b768-4b08b616f5df", "text": "我想要棕色的鞋，不是黑色的。", "shortMeaning": "我要棕色鞋，不是黑的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:84768cac-3e04-4fc2-923b-1851db02bebe", "text": "我想要永远活下去。", "shortMeaning": "我想永远活着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ca05b56e-ea39-451c-b0a3-80f5414ca74d", "text": "我想要点当日套餐。", "shortMeaning": "我想要份当日套餐。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3e38ce4f-2e93-4061-bdd8-63467c984417", "text": "我想要的就是这个。", "shortMeaning": "我要的就是这个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7c6276f9-5d6b-4fae-83cb-3d8f151d0eec", "text": "我想见见他的父亲。", "shortMeaning": "我想见见他父亲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:377ab581-61e1-4f19-8ea9-efd175416b65", "text": "我想观察日本人在不同情况下的表现。", "shortMeaning": "我想观察日本人在不同场合的表现。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2b3b72ac-da27-4cee-b9a9-8df157632882", "text": "我想订一个周末全膳房。", "shortMeaning": "我想订一间周末全膳房。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ff909ab-6f22-4af7-942b-b9ed749754f8", "text": "我想订一张去温哥华的机票。", "shortMeaning": "我想订去温哥华的机票。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4a15f1d6-28b3-4cec-becc-12f66e54b7e5", "text": "我想订三个人的位子。", "shortMeaning": "我想订三个人的座位。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7b1d5ca9-38b7-4a22-b6aa-498af62df276", "text": "我想让他单独去做。", "shortMeaning": "我想让他独自去做。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0d88fd52-5359-44d2-8045-fca276f968d3", "text": "我想让你呆在原地。", "shortMeaning": "我想让你待在原地。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:60c7fe15-a95b-44c1-a012-e821ff79603c", "text": "我想让你帮我向老师请个假。", "shortMeaning": "我想让你帮我向老师请假。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:07fd7357-9ccf-4fa8-978a-6d26f51c4475", "text": "我想让你找到他们。", "shortMeaning": "我想请你找到他们。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5726f4b9-329f-4423-88ae-31f4cc0576c1", "text": "我想让你明白为啥你必须这么做。", "shortMeaning": "我想让你明白为什么必须这么做。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3f538e10-5b85-4e4c-aa04-6bc50da4d471", "text": "我想让你知道你对我有多重要。", "shortMeaning": "我想让你知道你对我多重要。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:046265a0-7a9c-4dd6-979b-b1d46e992313", "text": "我想让你读这本书。", "shortMeaning": "我想请你读这本书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ad9bbb11-5073-4cd1-aec6-6d6e738dc935", "text": "我想让这次变得不一样。", "shortMeaning": "我想让这次有所不同。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f1a85c1e-0277-4f2f-a863-6a57575912fd", "text": "我想试一下那条蓝色条纹裙。", "shortMeaning": "我想试那条蓝色条纹裙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f075787a-e28e-46aa-a779-942f3831b2a3", "text": "我想起来关门后，我把钥匙留在里面了。", "shortMeaning": "我想起来关门后把钥匙留在里面了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e3c7dd2a-d9d0-4535-9070-205157737d98", "text": "我想跟你这样的人结婚。", "shortMeaning": "我想和像你这样的人结婚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:42f29af8-868d-4423-a9b3-5d617e173ee6", "text": "我想跟她谈谈我的薪水问题。", "shortMeaning": "我想跟她谈我的薪水问题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a40c1bdd-2290-4586-aaed-9d630c523fd8", "text": "我想过扇你一巴掌。", "shortMeaning": "我曾想过扇你一巴掌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7e0fea1f-178b-4e44-89e2-a4e233cd8eea", "text": "我想还待一夜，行不行？", "shortMeaning": "我想再待一夜，行不行？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c5a17309-a7de-4fe9-a2ed-613d4b2bf479", "text": "我想这药会对您有好处的。", "shortMeaning": "我想这药会对您有好处。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a094ebf-403c-4ea2-a643-7434f6ac61b4", "text": "我想那是最好的方法。", "shortMeaning": "我想那是最好的办法。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5c5b3f8b-dc17-4c42-a74c-fbe3dc6c7805", "text": "我想重新确认和你的预约。", "shortMeaning": "我想和你再确认预约。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:76499604-2223-42df-b9d9-e0b7dc8fa584", "text": "我想问他会不会说方言。", "shortMeaning": "我想问他会不会讲方言。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:464e5a03-5172-40cf-a3d5-3dbfc783fd29", "text": "我想问他的电话号码是多少。", "shortMeaning": "我想问他电话号码是多少。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:551b50a3-0d03-4931-83b8-08938aff6c9d", "text": "我想问你一个问题。", "shortMeaning": "我想问你个问题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bcdfd237-d2db-4cc4-adaa-44c740248b6a", "text": "我想麻烦你一件事儿。", "shortMeaning": "我想麻烦你一件事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:226c50c1-8fba-483e-aaad-71b0f207de93", "text": "我想，当你从更长远的角度考虑时，情况就会不同了。", "shortMeaning": "我想，从更长远的角度考虑，情况就会不同。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:298a5ca3-eb50-4cc1-a71f-706cabebd22f", "text": "我意大利语读都读不了，更不要提说和写了。", "shortMeaning": "我意大利语读都读不了，更别说写和说了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:498857fa-7be7-4b11-b297-eb64a1676e95", "text": "我意识到我是多么的幸运，命运给了我这么多重来的机会。", "shortMeaning": "我意识到自己多幸运，命运给了这么多重来的机会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:33d8fd43-8c81-4c7b-ad49-8e7c50cc343d", "text": "我意识到虽然中国发展得很快，中国人还有比较悠闲的生活。", "shortMeaning": "我意识到中国虽发展很快，人们仍过得比较悠闲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6647a204-56d1-4b97-b94f-4c0ae576e2f1", "text": "我意识到要实行这件事是很困难的。", "shortMeaning": "我意识到要实行这件事很难。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2b760d02-f3aa-43dd-ba3d-7ffefd03ae98", "text": "我意识到这个可怕的地下室是唯一可以救我们命的地方。", "shortMeaning": "我意识到这可怕的地下室是唯一能救命的地方。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:92d26306-93e4-4334-b6d6-fe8e732b2ce9", "text": "我感到凄清与孤独。", "shortMeaning": "我感到凄凉与孤独。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8606fb86-43e5-4207-9006-6ddf14790f9d", "text": "我感到背上有东西动。", "shortMeaning": "我感到背上有东西在动。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2bc60011-c64f-47d0-b90d-5309288a09c2", "text": "我感情上支持，但是理性上反对。", "shortMeaning": "我感情上支持，但理性上反对。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a657a456-da81-4be3-892d-7233643312e7", "text": "我感觉他似乎心不在焉。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉他好像心不在焉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:09a42f0f-c598-4a9b-840a-1e5ebda4ffb7", "text": "我感觉你不是很热。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉你不太热。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b10adbf6-004d-4e66-9ccf-fcfda9c65270", "text": "我感觉你想告诉我什么事。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉你有事想告诉我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b2d9a5f8-9416-4524-ab25-efbc3cee6637", "text": "我感觉你还没把视频看完。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉你还没看完视频。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e1e70865-7e0e-48e2-a49b-1bfcf131cd95", "text": "我感觉像羽毛一样轻飘。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉轻飘得像羽毛。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1721aff1-156e-461b-ae2f-011cc37a5fbd", "text": "我感觉到我是自由的。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉自己是自由的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eb51d845-49b1-44da-8267-7824901d535e", "text": "我感觉困得几乎不能睁开我的眼睛了。", "shortMeaning": "我困得几乎睁不开眼睛。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:684aa34f-e3af-4aa7-883e-8b9c7c135f2c", "text": "我感觉大家都在关注我。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉大家都在看我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:792b0c0f-45ab-4d3e-aec7-26ba9cef97bf", "text": "我感觉就像做梦一样。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉像在做梦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:88cb33d4-588b-430b-93c8-a121f8eb6da1", "text": "我感觉心都跳到嗓子眼里了。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉心都跳到嗓子眼了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b6f8cb00-0e84-4fed-bb8e-55c959d99aef", "text": "我感觉我做了件十分愚蠢的事。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉自己做了件很蠢的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:865599f4-b9c3-449b-9fcc-0d61745a530d", "text": "我感觉我已经比之前好点了。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉已经比之前好些了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:341eba0b-5025-4356-b7c9-dff10da69a40", "text": "我感觉我来过这里。", "shortMeaning": "我觉得这地方我来过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5c22e5de-c020-456e-bce5-638899ce29d2", "text": "我感觉我的心跳得很快。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉心跳得很快。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6bdf27fe-8cf0-4903-9c99-4ad692d5b0a7", "text": "我感觉我被强制帮助她。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉被强迫去帮她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f6994bc1-9027-4d5c-a790-72963a7f7e4d", "text": "我感觉昏昏沉沉的。", "shortMeaning": "我头昏沉沉的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:53651214-4a78-4d72-a7cc-a5d722803442", "text": "我感觉有些轻飘飘了。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉有些轻飘飘的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:afa51d5f-f874-4f87-8e69-99c5a6b7ae28", "text": "我感觉有滴雨落在头上。", "shortMeaning": "我觉着一滴雨落在头上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:62f3de0d-faba-49c5-84e3-c316a1a39873", "text": "我感觉窗子一整晚都开着。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉窗户开了一整晚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c40d96f8-fd8c-406c-b19f-6416b4aff93a", "text": "我感觉自己很聪明。。。可惜。。。这只是个感觉。。。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉自己很聪明，可惜只是感觉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3b47a1de-805c-470b-b6e6-338e5d271454", "text": "我感觉还不是那么饿。", "shortMeaning": "我感觉还不太饿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b87fae4d-0530-40d4-867d-196ab11292ad", "text": "我愿意参加巴士夜游。", "shortMeaning": "我愿意参加夜间巴士游。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e7d0b681-60b6-4d66-8ec7-6fb619d33725", "text": "我愿意帮助你，但我无法帮助。", "shortMeaning": "我愿意帮你，但帮不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:17f9055f-5fe7-4680-94bc-8b6242f8ac6a", "text": "我愿意无偿接下这件活。", "shortMeaning": "我愿意无偿接下这活儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:181bb311-244d-439d-9248-8c1b7d335b8d", "text": "我懒得整理我的头发，所以我看起来就像个懒汉。", "shortMeaning": "我懒得整理头发，所以看起来像个懒汉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:19e24ce0-3e5f-4c5a-9191-90a8caff5f3b", "text": "我成功地得到了我想要的。", "shortMeaning": "我成功得到了想要的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ebd49691-84cf-4b76-b8ca-77d84bfa1834", "text": "我或者去看电影，或者去看歌剧。", "shortMeaning": "我要么去看电影，要么看歌剧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c7a3d748-c589-4372-a192-d1164cd4b633", "text": "我或许不善于社交,但这并不意味我不和别人交谈。", "shortMeaning": "我或许不擅社交，但不代表不和人交谈。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d2c94191-33db-4f37-87ef-9b460675fb2d", "text": "我或许可以修好它。", "shortMeaning": "我或许能修好它。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9502071e-9dbc-4186-bcab-6b724a32c030", "text": "我户口本忘车上了。", "shortMeaning": "我把户口本忘车上了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2285b59e-36b8-4f82-9d37-95af17f689f2", "text": "我房间里家具不是很多。", "shortMeaning": "我房间里的家具不多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0ab0fa7b-2ea1-415e-945f-93f8f01449c7", "text": "我所想要的是一点平和和安静。", "shortMeaning": "我想要的是平静和安宁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:347c258d-cac8-4337-8c4b-f93603a85b47", "text": "我所有漂亮的衣服都随着我们烧毁的房子一起消失了。", "shortMeaning": "我所有漂亮衣服都随烧毁的房子一起没了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2bfff841-6331-4e5e-a0df-8c0bb5aa7d98", "text": "我所有的尝试都失败了。", "shortMeaning": "我的所有尝试都失败了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:88006373-c451-4be5-a1ea-4bc5c06875fa", "text": "我所爱的是白皙红润，千里挑一的。", "shortMeaning": "我爱的是白皙红润、千里挑一的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ffd2a6c7-12ea-4314-bf99-9b153a2d868a", "text": "我手机内存不够了。", "shortMeaning": "我手机存储不够了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:49e30219-0e75-4eb1-8317-5e7e595dc89c", "text": "我才不想看到你们的脸呢。", "shortMeaning": "我才不想看到你们呢。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ffd0fb67-4258-4110-bab3-a3a5f4feee49", "text": "我才不管你累不累呢。", "shortMeaning": "我才不管你累不累。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3efa4c55-884c-410e-8dbc-3907347ddf63", "text": "我才不管别人怎么想我。", "shortMeaning": "我才不管别人怎么看我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e5e5e51-82d7-4186-aeda-613eda876e69", "text": "我才感冒一天没来上班，桌上就堆满了文件。", "shortMeaning": "我才感冒一天没上班，桌上就堆满文件。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:11da63f1-2cd9-4cc7-98b7-e63945086877", "text": "我才是那个想和你在一起的人！", "shortMeaning": "想和你在一起的人是我！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3e16e847-20c4-4b6c-a8a9-6c7448b92ba3", "text": "我打心底里感激你。", "shortMeaning": "我打心底感激你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5d418efa-33ec-4a62-bb8b-f817bfbdb955", "text": "我打电话的时候，她刚回到家。", "shortMeaning": "我打电话时她刚到家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5dc82139-b7b4-4eaa-91bf-a4df3e1cac1f", "text": "我打电话给你，一方面是想请你吃饭，另一方面是想告诉你我儿子要结婚了。", "shortMeaning": "我打给你，一是想请你吃饭，二是想告诉你我儿子要结婚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:13b644b6-4b93-4f9c-abb2-a03e6c47c960", "text": "我打电话给你，一来是想请你吃饭，二来是想告诉你我儿子要结婚了。", "shortMeaning": "我打给你，一来请你吃饭，二来告诉你我儿子要结婚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:08f71b06-52d9-4222-8a84-9d849f069742", "text": "我打电话订了个披萨。", "shortMeaning": "我打电话订了披萨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6302ee51-8882-459e-a713-3e45ad569c8d", "text": "我打的这辆出租车很老，也很小。", "shortMeaning": "我打的这辆出租车又老又小。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9e7b9101-34b2-4cfc-9a31-272ffb820b84", "text": "我打破了和我上司的约定。", "shortMeaning": "我违背了和上司的约定。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:19135667-39e5-46ad-bb5f-8bf6367cb064", "text": "我打碎了一只茶杯。", "shortMeaning": "我打碎了一个茶杯。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:63950c10-1f5e-4156-80b6-0dd5b51310ba", "text": "我打算今晚和她约会。", "shortMeaning": "我今晚打算和她约会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bf203572-fe34-4597-8b75-e2e73e738c77", "text": "我打算住在城市里。", "shortMeaning": "我打算住城里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6ec1f902-dc65-409c-986a-8f17ebdc2a68", "text": "我打算去北海道滑雪。", "shortMeaning": "我计划去北海道滑雪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:133e5238-5e29-405d-80fd-e74dd71b0118", "text": "我打算在澳大利亚过新年。", "shortMeaning": "我打算去澳大利亚过新年。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a0758957-f643-4f49-aa78-e9722e21c637", "text": "我打算夏天去欧洲。", "shortMeaning": "我计划夏天去欧洲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d3b0a534-d7c9-4941-89af-1d944839b378", "text": "我打算成为工程师。", "shortMeaning": "我打算当工程师。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:72cf9916-5bf7-4445-9379-ae9d1ad4bd57", "text": "我打算明年去加拿大。", "shortMeaning": "我计划明年去加拿大。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2c0ec4dd-fb29-48de-9e0b-0b0f0521d6df", "text": "我打算明年去美国。", "shortMeaning": "我计划明年去美国。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:583f38ff-0e49-40ee-bae5-b07bd4def518", "text": "我打算明年去美国留学。", "shortMeaning": "我计划明年去美国留学。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4e09c7bb-4285-4cc9-93dd-3f9443203f6a", "text": "我打算留在城市里。", "shortMeaning": "我打算留城里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fbf2949e-623d-4660-a8df-a1e8859401e9", "text": "我打算给自己买辆摩托车。", "shortMeaning": "我打算给自己买辆摩托。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6430ac19-a226-4795-a3a9-86bd1f0a35fa", "text": "我打给你一方面是想请你吃晚餐，另一方面是想告诉你，我的儿子要结婚了。", "shortMeaning": "我打给你，一方面想请你吃晚餐，另一方面想告诉你我儿子要结婚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7947819b-8676-4296-b0d6-eb4a435b0c8a", "text": "我扔了块石头打向鸟儿。", "shortMeaning": "我扔石头打鸟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bfd228f0-4bf6-4b43-8e7e-f0636f8498ca", "text": "我扯掉了自己的裤子。", "shortMeaning": "我把自己裤子扯掉了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4867d3e9-d8b7-4a29-8840-22c668b7c55b", "text": "我找不到合适的词汇来表达我的感受。", "shortMeaning": "我找不到合适的词表达感受。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b2d084e6-ea09-46c4-8d12-73337032636c", "text": "我找不到我三件套的背心。", "shortMeaning": "我找不到三件套里的背心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cfcbaca0-09c8-410a-91f8-a4df384d93e0", "text": "我找不到我的包了。", "shortMeaning": "我找不到自己的包了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c24942a-84ac-40bd-8c9d-030f7d1f2083", "text": "我找不到我的手提箱。", "shortMeaning": "我找不到手提箱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:045014a9-a09e-49e7-a6bd-6a0c66541d04", "text": "我找不到我的鞋子。", "shortMeaning": "我找不到鞋子了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:04118e16-0903-4258-8808-8f3a6c798385", "text": "我找到一个买水果很便宜的地方。", "shortMeaning": "我找到一个买水果便宜的地方。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
